                "comment": "This guy honestly cannot teach they need to find a competent professor for this course. Rob is nice and whatever but his TA's teach better than him. Also his canvas page is nonexistent and he started grading our work from SEPTEMBER A WEEK BEFORE FINALS. So yeah, virtually no feedback because stuff is graded on participation as well",
